[ti:कागद काली कलम]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Cinematic & Other]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]🎵 KA KAA RAHASYA
[00:14.97]Narrator-Style Mystical Ballad
[00:18.46]🎵 k.. ka... kaa... kaaa... kyaa...
[00:21.95]🎵 k.. ka...
[00:25.44]🎵 Fir kahe ko kahe ko kahe kau
[00:28.92]🎵 Fir kaalaa kaagad kaalee kalam
[00:32.41]🎵 Fir kaal likhe kaal mitaave
[00:35.90]🎵 Fir kaa kaa arth na jaane koi
[00:39.39]🎤 कः इति ब्रह्म। प्रश्नः एव सृष्टिः। (Yāska)
[00:42.87]🎵 kaa... kaaa...
[00:46.36]🎵 Fir kaahe kaahe kaahe re kaa
[00:49.85]🎵 Fir ka kha ga gha – sab teraa khel
[00:53.33]🎵 Fir khaali kaagar kaahe bulaave
[00:56.82]🎵 Fir kaam krodh kaa maare mel
[01:00.31]🎵 kyaa...
[01:03.80]🎤 नादात्मकं जगत्सर्वं नाद एव परं पदम् (Gorakhnath)
[01:07.28]🎵 ka kau ke – Fir ka se kau – teeno taar
[01:10.77]🎵 ken kabhyaam – dohraa dvaar
[01:14.26]🎵 kai kahe kai baar – kaa ke beech mein kaun karaar
[01:17.75]🎵 kavim kaviim kavayah – Fir kavi bhi kya jaane kaa kaa arth
[01:21.23]🎵 Fir kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:24.72]🎤 कः – कौ – के | केन – काभ्याम् – कैः (Pāṇini)
[01:28.21]🎵 kahaam katham kathaam
[01:31.69]🎵 Fir kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:35.18]🎵 Fir katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:38.67]🎵 Fir kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:42.16]🎵 Fir kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:45.64]🎤 ಎಲ್ಲ ಕವಿಗಳು ಹೋದರು – ಗುಹೇಶ್ವರನ ಲಿಂಗವ ಬಲ್ಲವರಾರು (Allama Prabhu)
[01:49.13]🎵 kasmin kyo keshu
[01:52.62]🎵 Fir kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:56.11]🎵 Fir keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:59.59]🎵 Fir kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[02:03.08]🎵 Fir kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[02:06.57]🎤 ੴ ਸਤਿ ਨਾਮੁ ਕਰਤਾ ਪੁਰਖੁ (Guru Nanak)
[02:10.05]🎵 ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[02:13.54]🎵 kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[02:17.03]🎵 nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[02:20.52]🎵 e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[02:24.00]🎵 kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:27.49]🎵 kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:30.98]🎵 Fir kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:34.47]🎵 Fir kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:37.95]🎵 Fir karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:41.44]🎵 Fir kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:44.93]🎵 Fir kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:48.41]🎤 ਕੜਾ, ਕਛੈਰਾ, ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ, ਕੰਘੀ, ਕੇਸ – ਇਹ ਪੰਜ ਕਕਾਰੇ ਸਾਚੇ ਭੇਸ (Guru Gobind Singh tradition)
[02:51.90]🎵 sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:55.39]🎵 Fir sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:58.88]🎵 bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[03:02.36]🎵 kaal jo pahichaan liya – rahasya aap hi aaya
[03:05.85]🎵 chanddalaa de dna nai – onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[03:09.34]🎵 Fir dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[03:12.83]🎵 kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[03:16.31]🎤 कंकर काहे करै तक़रीर – काबा कौन, कौन बुतखाना (Kabir)
[03:19.80]🎵 khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:23.29]🎵 kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:26.77]🎵 kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:30.26]🎵 kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:33.75]🎵 kaafir kahe kaaba chale – qazi kahe qabar chale
[03:37.24]🎵 kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[03:40.72]🎵 kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[03:44.21]🎵 kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[03:47.70]🎵 kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[03:51.19]🎵 kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[03:54.67]🎵 kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[03:58.16]🎵 khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[04:01.65]🎵 kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[04:05.13]🎵 kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[04:08.62]🎵 kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[04:12.11]🎵 kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[04:15.60]🎵 kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:19.08]🎵 kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:22.57]🎵 keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:26.06]🎵 ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:29.55]🎵 ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:33.03]🎵 kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:36.52]🎵 kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:40.01]🎵 ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:43.49]🎵 kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:46.98]🎵 jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:50.47]🎵 so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
[04:53.96]🎵 ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[04:57.44]🎵 kya kaun kab kaise kahan – nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[05:00.93]🎵 e mera naanak we matwaalaa – kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[05:04.42]🎵 kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[05:07.91]🎵 sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[05:11.39]🎵 chanddalaa de dna nai – onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[05:14.88]🕉️ Call & Response:
[05:18.37]जेह? → so ka
[05:21.85]कवन? → so khaas
[05:25.34]कहाँ? → so khanjar
[05:28.83]किस करण? → so kiran
[05:32.32]🕉️ All: so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
[05:35.80]🎵 ka kau ke – ken kabhyaam kai
[05:39.29]🎵 kavim kaviim kavayah
[05:42.78]🎵 kahaam katham kathaam – kasmin kyo keshu
[05:46.27]🎵 kaa... kaaa... kyaa?
